<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n53565" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καρχᾰλέος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">α</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>rough</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δίψῃ καρχαλέοι</span>
			<i>rough in the throat</i> with thirst, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				21.541
			</span></i> (
				v.l.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καρφαλέοι</span>
			), cf. <i><span class="en">
				A.R.
				4.1442
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Nonn.
				<u>D.</u>
				14.426
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>rough, fierce</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κύνες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.R.
					3.1058
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λύκοι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Tryph.
					615
				</span></i>
			 (
				v.l.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καρχαρέος</span>
			); of sounds, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Χρεμετισμός,
			ἱμάσθλη</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Nonn.
				<u>D.</u>
				29.199
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				48.307
			</span></i>; of fire, <i>fierce</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Nic.
				<u>Th.</u>
				691
			</span></i> (
				v.l.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καρφ-</span>
			, q.v.). (Redupl. of <i>khar-</i>, cf. Skt.
				<i>khára-</i> 'rough, sharp'.)</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
